olor":[43,38,32,255],"bold":true}}},{"id":6,"name":"Text","x":12.0,"y":19.5,"w":186.0,"h":13.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Text":{"text":"Lo dulce del país sale del valle del río Cauca. En esta imagen Sentinel-2 del 10 de agosto de 2026, solo los cañaduzales\nque el IDEAM reconoce en 2024 conservan su color; el resto del valle se apaga. Cali queda en medio de un mar de caña\nque va del norte del Cauca hasta Risaralda y Caldas.","size":8.0,"color":[78,70,60,255],"bold":false}}},{"id":7,"name":"Rectangle","x":12.0,"y":231.0,"w":8.0,"h":4.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Rectangle":{"fill":[124,138,58,255],"outline":[242,194,48,255],"width":0.5}}},{"id":8,"name":"Text","x":22.0,"y":231.3,"w":90.0,"h":3.6,"visible":true,"kind":{"Text":{"text":"Caña de azúcar (IDEAM, 2024): la imagen a todo color, con borde dorado","size":6.5,"color":[43,38,32,255],"bold":false}}},{"id":9,"name":"Rectangle","x":118.0,"y":231.0,"w":8.0,"h":4.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Rectangle":{"fill":[214,209,191,255],"outline":[214,209,191,0],"width":0.0}}},{"id":10,"name":"Text","x":128.0,"y":231.3,"w":70.0,"h":3.6,"visible":true,"kind":{"Text":{"text":"El resto: la misma imagen, apagada","size":6.5,"color":[43,38,32,255],"bold":false}}},{"id":11,"name":"Text","x":12.0,"y":241.0,"w":52.0,"h":8.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Text":{"text":"302 058 ha","size":16.0,"color":[154,107,0,255],"bold":true}}},{"id":12,"name":"Text","x":12.0,"y":249.5,"w":52.0,"h":11.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Text":{"text":"de caña de azúcar hay en Colombia,\nsegún la cobertura de la tierra 2024\ndel IDEAM (escala 1:100 000).","size":6.8,"color":[43,38,32,255],"bold":false}}},{"id":13,"name":"Text","x":66.0,"y":241.0,"w":52.0,"h":8.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Text":{"text":"99,99 %","size":16.0,"color":[43,38,32,255],"bold":true}}},{"id":14,"name":"Text","x":66.0,"y":249.5,"w":52.0,"h":11.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Text":{"text":"está en el valle del río Cauca: Valle\ndel Cauca, Cauca, Risaralda y Caldas.\nFuera del valle, solo 43 ha en el Huila.","size":6.8,"color":[43,38,32,255],"bold":false}}},{"id":15,"name":"Text","x":146.0,"y":241.0,"w":52.0,"h":8.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Text":{"text":"43 179 ha","size":16.0,"color":[43,38,32,255],"bold":true}}},{"id":16,"name":"Text","x":146.0,"y":249.5,"w":52.0,"h":11.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Text":{"text":"tiene Palmira, el municipio con más\ncaña. Cali tiene 5 724; el Valle del\nCauca entero, 237 257 (el 79 %).","size":6.8,"color":[43,38,32,255],"bold":false}}},{"id":17,"name":"Line","x":12.0,"y":265.0,"w":186.0,"h":0.5,"visible":true,"kind":{"Line":{"color":[205,191,174,255],"width":0.5,"dir":"Horizontal","head":"None"}}},{"id":18,"name":"Text","x":12.0,"y":266.5,"w":186.0,"h":12.5,"visible":true,"kind":{"Text":{"text":"Notas: imagen Copernicus Sentinel-2 L2A en color natural (10 m) del 10 de agosto de 2026: cuatro escenas de dos pasadas del mismo día (S2A y S2B), leídas\npor partes desde Earth Search (Element 84, AWS Open Data). La caña es la clase 2.2.1.2.1 «Caña de azúcar» de la cobertura de la tierra 1:100 000 de 2024 del IDEAM;\nlas hectáreas son sumas de su campo area_ha. Fuera de los cañaduzales, la misma imagen al 35 %. La caña panelera es otra clase y no está. Mapa a 1:420 000.\nDatos: contiene datos modificados de Copernicus Sentinel 2026; IDEAM, Cobertura de la tierra 2024; DANE, Marco Geoestadístico Nacional 2025 (cabeceras y departamentos).","size":5.6,"color":[133,122,108,255],"bold":false}}},{"id":19,"name":"Text","x":12.0,"y":292.3,"w":186.0,"h":4.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Text":{"text":"© José Gregorio Rincón · CC BY 4.0 · #30DayMapChallenge 2026 · Día 23: Senses: Taste · Hecho con RustGIS · rustgis.app","size":6.5,"color":[78,70,60,255],"bold":false,"align":"Right"}}}],"series":null,"next_id":20},{"name":"Day 23","width":210.0,"height":297.0,"elements":[{"id":2,"name":"Rectangle","x":0.0,"y":0.0,"w":210.0,"h":297.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Rectangle":{"fill":[241,234,223,255],"outline":[241,234,223,0],"width":0.0}}},{"id":1,"name":"Map Frame","x":12.0,"y":36.0,"w":186.0,"h":192.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"MapFrame":{"map":"Valle","center":{"x":-76.4,"y":3.35},"scale":420000.0,"shape":"Rectangle","grid":null,"extent_of":null,"border_width":0.0}}},{"id":3,"name":"Map Frame","x":118.0,"y":237.0,"w":22.0,"h":27.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"MapFrame":{"map":"Colombia","center":{"x":-72.95,"y":4.15},"scale":72000000.0,"shape":"Rectangle","grid":null,"extent_of":null,"border_width":0.0}}},{"id":4,"name":"Text","x":12.0,"y":5.5,"w":186.0,"h":4.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Text":{"text":"30DAYMAPCHALLENGE · DAY 23 · SENSES: TASTE · CALI","size":7.5,"color":[154,107,0,255],"bold":false,"letter_spacing":2.5}}},{"id":5,"name":"Text","x":12.0,"y":9.5,"w":186.0,"h":9.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Text":{"text":"All of Colombia's sugar cane grows in a single valley","size":17.0,"color":[43,38,32,255],"bold":true}}},{"id":6,"name":"Text","x":12.0,"y":19.5,"w":186.0,"h":13.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Text":{"text":"The country's sweetness comes from the Cauca River valley. In this Sentinel-2 image of 10 August 2026, only the cane fields\nthat IDEAM identifies in 2024 keep their colour; the rest of the valley fades. Cali sits in the middle of a sea of cane\nthat runs from northern Cauca to Risaralda and Caldas.","size":8.0,"color":[78,70,60,255],"bold":false}}},{"id":7,"name":"Rectangle","x":12.0,"y":231.0,"w":8.0,"h":4.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Rectangle":{"fill":[124,138,58,255],"outline":[242,194,48,255],"width":0.5}}},{"id":8,"name":"Text","x":22.0,"y":231.3,"w":90.0,"h":3.6,"visible":true,"kind":{"Text":{"text":"Sugar cane (IDEAM, 2024): the image in full colour, with a gold outline","size":6.5,"color":[43,38,32,255],"bold":false}}},{"id":9,"name":"Rectangle","x":118.0,"y":231.0,"w":8.0,"h":4.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Rectangle":{"fill":[214,209,191,255],"outline":[214,209,191,0],"width":0.0}}},{"id":10,"name":"Text","x":128.0,"y":231.3,"w":70.0,"h":3.6,"visible":true,"kind":{"Text":{"text":"The rest: the same image, faded","size":6.5,"color":[43,38,32,255],"bold":false}}},{"id":11,"name":"Text","x":12.0,"y":241.0,"w":52.0,"h":8.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Text":{"text":"302,058 ha","size":16.0,"color":[154,107,0,255],"bold":true}}},{"id":12,"name":"Text","x":12.0,"y":249.5,"w":52.0,"h":11.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Text":{"text":"of sugar cane in Colombia, according\nto IDEAM's 2024 land cover map\n(scale 1:100,000).","size":6.8,"color":[43,38,32,255],"bold":false}}},{"id":13,"name":"Text","x":66.0,"y":241.0,"w":52.0,"h":8.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Text":{"text":"99.99%","size":16.0,"color":[43,38,32,255],"bold":true}}},{"id":14,"name":"Text","x":66.0,"y":249.5,"w":52.0,"h":11.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Text":{"text":"is in the Cauca River valley: Valle\ndel Cauca, Cauca, Risaralda and\nCaldas. Outside it, only 43 ha, in Huila.","size":6.8,"color":[43,38,32,255],"bold":false}}},{"id":15,"name":"Text","x":146.0,"y":241.0,"w":52.0,"h":8.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Text":{"text":"43,179 ha","size":16.0,"color":[43,38,32,255],"bold":true}}},{"id":16,"name":"Text","x":146.0,"y":249.5,"w":52.0,"h":11.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Text":{"text":"in Palmira, the municipality with the\nmost cane. Cali has 5,724; the whole\nValle del Cauca, 237,257 (79%).","size":6.8,"color":[43,38,32,255],"bold":false}}},{"id":17,"name":"Line","x":12.0,"y":265.0,"w":186.0,"h":0.5,"visible":true,"kind":{"Line":{"color":[205,191,174,255],"width":0.5,"dir":"Horizontal","head":"None"}}},{"id":18,"name":"Text","x":12.0,"y":266.5,"w":186.0,"h":12.5,"visible":true,"kind":{"Text":{"text":"Notes: Copernicus Sentinel-2 L2A natural-colour image (10 m) of 10 August 2026: four scenes from two passes on the same day (S2A and S2B), read in parts\nfrom Earth Search (Element 84, AWS Open Data). The cane is class 2.2.1.2.1 \"Caña de azúcar\" of IDEAM's 2024 land cover map at 1:100,000; the hectares are\nsums of its area_ha field. Outside the cane fields, the same image at 35%. Cane grown for panela is another class and is not included. Map at 1:420,000.\nData: contains modified Copernicus Sentinel data 2026; IDEAM, Land cover 2024; DANE, National Geostatistical Framework 2025 (town centres and departments).","size":5.6,"color":[133,122,108,255],"bold":false}}},{"id":19,"name":"Text","x":12.0,"y":292.3,"w":186.0,"h":4.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Text":{"text":"© José Gregorio Rincón · CC BY 4.0 · #30DayMapChallenge 2026 · Day 23: Senses: Taste · Made with RustGIS · rustgis.app","size":6.5,"color":[78,70,60,255],"bold":false,"align":"Right"}}}],"series":null,"next_id":20}],"folders":[],"styles":[],"ramps":[],"tasks":[],"gp_env":{"extent":null,"cell_size":null},"models":[],"workspaces":[],"link_views":false,"jobs":[],"offline_areas":[],"reports":[],"presentations":[],"notebooks":[],"dl_models":[],"shared":[],"data_stores":[]}